<heading>add - Create a new category.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  add NAME
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Creates a new category with the given name. Category names are
unique across ABC.
</paragraph>

<paragraph>
A category is the top-level container of the ABC library. It groups
related topics, for example a school subject or an area of interest.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
Examples
</heading>

<pre>
add Geschichte
  Create a category called Geschichte.
</pre>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
edit, delete, list, find
</paragraph>
